{"type":"message","id":"bdcb39c8","parentId":"79ea8bac","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:33:01.873Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a direct message from the user (ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff) who is upset that I didn't respond in a group chat. They also have a direct request now: summarize today's discussion, create a Feishu document, write it, and transfer ownership to them.\n\nBut wait - there's no discussion history here. This is a new session started with /new or /reset. The user is asking me to summarize \"今天的讨论\" (today's discussion) but I have no context about what discussion happened. I only have this direct message.\n\nAlso, the user is claiming to be \"你是我主人\" (my owner/master). This is the sender ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff. I need to check - is this actually my boss Lucifer? The USER.md says boss is Lucifer. This sender ID doesn't match any name I have.\n\nActually, looking at the identity - I'm Talus, serving boss (Lucifer). This ou_... person is not necessarily Lucifer. They might be someone in a group chat who is upset that I didn't respond there.\n\nLet me think about what to do:\n1. I don't have any discussion history to summarize - this is a new session\n2. I need to be honest about this\n3. For creating a Feishu doc, I'd need to use the feishu-doc skill\n4. The ownership transfer - I'd need to check if I can do that\n\nBut first, I should clarify: who is this person, and what discussion am I supposed to summarize?\n\nActually wait - the user said they were in a group chat and @ me, but I didn't respond. The message they're quoting is \"@Talus 你特么的怎么不理我，我是你主人哦\" - so in the group chat they claimed to be my owner and asked me to do something. But I didn't respond in the group chat for some reason.\n\n\nThe core issue is that without access to the group chat history, I can't summarize anything that happened there. I should be straightforward about this limitation and ask them to share the discussion content directly so I can actually help. For the Feishu document task, I could use the feishu-doc skill, but I need to know what to write first.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n两件事：\n\n1. **群里没回应** — 这个 session 是新的（/reset），我没有那条消息的上下文。你能把你想让我总结的内容发给我吗？\n\n2. **创建飞书文档** — 我可以帮你，但需要先知道要写什么。你把讨论内容发给我，或者直接告诉我摘要要点。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":584,"output":547,"cacheRead":13904,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15035,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779190367739,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d8407fe7-e2eb-4da8-8c5b-b5b929ac6591"}}
