{"type":"message","id":"ebf043f4","parentId":"bf4da876","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:34:11.610Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand how to create a Feishu doc. I need to:\n1. Create the document with the title\n2. Set owner_open_id to the sender's open_id\n3. Write the content\n\nThe sender's open_id is `ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff` (from the metadata).\n\nLet me create the document first, then write the content.\n\nThe content to write is the summary from the messages.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-8254519e-6798-437e-8a23-18d6b1cba5f9","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /app/dist/extensions/feishu && node -e \"\nconst { feishu_doc } = require('./src/feishu-doc-tool.js');\nfeishu_doc({ action: 'create', title: 'ECHO 模拟器 · 5 Agent 协作实验总结 · 2026-05-19', owner_open_id: 'ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff' }).then(r => console.log(JSON.stringify(r, null, 2)));\n\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":16573,"output":236,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16921,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779190437695,"responseId":"chatcmpl-66771cab-4942-44f6-ba60-3cd52b8917b7"}}
