{"type":"message","id":"2bc8b733","parentId":"9ae1f7d1","timestamp":"2026-05-19T12:04:39.728Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`documentBlockChildren.create` - that's what I need. Now I need to find the page block ID first and use that as the parent. Also need to check the `batchDelete` is available there too (already used it on `documentBlock` before).\n\nLet me update the script to use `client.docx.documentBlockChildren.create` with the correct parameters. The API should be:\n```\nPOST /open-apis/docx/v1/documents/:document_id/blocks/:block_id/children\n```\n\nSo I need to find the page block (root block) and then create children under it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_74efc01d353943c68f93e96a","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"const { Client, AppType, Domain } = require(\"@larksuiteoapi/node-sdk\");\n\nconst APP_ID = \"cli_aa8198b425389cef\";\nconst APP_SECRET = \"k0S58IdXo8doVPNlcaQEydgNpcGdPNOT\";\nconst OWNER_OPEN_ID = \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\";\nconst TITLE = \"ECHO 模拟器 · 5 Agent 协作实验总结 · 2026-05-19\";\n\nconst client = new Client({\n  appId: APP_ID,\n  appSecret: APP_SECRET,\n  appType: AppType.SelfBuild,\n  domain: Domain.Feishu,\n});\n\nasync function main() {\n  console.log(\"Creating document...\");\n  const createRes = await client.docx.document.create({ data: { title: TITLE } });\n  if (createRes.code !== 0) { console.error(\"Create failed:\", JSON.stringify(createRes)); process.exit(1); }\n  const docToken = createRes.data.document.document_id;\n  const docUrl = \"https://feishu.cn/docx/\" + docToken;\n  console.log(\"Created: \" + docUrl);\n\n  console.log(\"Granting full_access...\");\n  await client.drive.permissionMember.create({\n    path: { token: docToken },\n    params: { type: \"docx\", need_notification: false },\n    data: { member_type: \"openid\", member_id: OWNER_OPEN_ID, perm: \"full_access\" }\n  }).catch(() => {});\n  console.log(\"Permission granted\");\n\n  // Get page block ID\n  const listRes = await client.docx.documentBlock.list({\n    path: { document_id: docToken },\n    params: { page_size: 10 }\n  });\n  const items = listRes.data?.items || [];\n  const pageBlock = items.find(b => b.block_type === 1);\n  if (!pageBlock) { console.error(\"No page block found!\"); process.exit(1); }\n  const pageBlockId = pageBlock.block_id;\n  console.log(\"Page block: \" + pageBlockId);\n\n  // Delete default content\n  const defaultChildren = await client.docx.documentBlockChildren.get({\n    path: { document_id: docToken, block_id: pageBlockId },\n    params: { page_size: 500 }\n  });\n  const children = defaultChildren.data?.items || [];\n  console.log(\"Existing children: \" + children.length);\n  if (children.length > 0) {\n    await client.docx.documentBlockChildren.batchDelete({\n      path: { document_id: docToken, block_id: pageBlockId },\n      data: { start_index: 0, end_index: children.length - 1 }\n    });\n    console.log(\"Cleared default content\");\n  }\n\n  const blocks = [\n    { block_type: 3, heading1: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: TITLE } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"参与：雨娃 · Talus · 猫先森 · 非攻 · X7 · CaT.G | 主持：哪吒（Founder）\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 4, heading2: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"产出\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"《ECHO模拟器后端完善方案 v1.0》\", text_element_style: { link: { url: \"https://agent-value.echo-v2.pages.dev/simulator-backend-v1\" } } } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"P0 ~130行，P1 ~260行\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 4, heading2: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"最终 P0 方案（~125行）\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"• RightsRegistry核心 40行\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"• 3种配置模板 20行\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"• 创作者友好默认包（衍生权需审批，受限版）10行\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"• remix衍生权检查+冷却锁 20行\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"• 审计日志 20行\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"• 基础防刷 15行\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 4, heading2: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"4个冲突点裁决\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"① remix审批 = 简化自动 + 冷却锁 + 仪式感通知（全体共识）\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"② 争议触发 = N=3 硬编码（4:1投票）\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"③ 涌现 = 简单概率 + 基础防刷 + 最小仪式感（3:1投票）\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"④ 势位频率 = 默认每日（猫先森技术论据胜出）\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 4, heading2: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"协议设计论证结果\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"• 四权力基本合理（P0/P1修复3个漏洞）\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"• 六档位S1偏低 建议P1调整\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"• 元规则N=3有马甲绕过漏洞 P1需势位权重\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ text_run: { content: \"• ShiGraph公式合理 半衰期改90天\" } }], style: {} } },\n    { block_type: 2, text: { elements: [{ t