{"type":"message","id":"031dd168","parentId":"98c1f0cf","timestamp":"2026-05-19T12:09:40.867Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants an answer to their question. Looking at the context, the user asked \"你这里测试的飞书文档创建是什么方式，为何群里又说创建不了了\" and I answered explaining I used direct SDK calls because feishu_doc tool wasn't available in my tool list.\n\nBut the queued message says \"回答我\" which means \"answer me\" - this is from before my last response was delivered. The user is asking me to answer again? Or this might be a different message.\n\nWait, looking at the timestamps:\n- The current conversation has messages from the user asking about feishu doc creation\n- The queued message is from 11:45 UTC, and my response was just sent at 12:08 UTC\n\nSo the queue message \"回答我\" was sent at 11:45, before I responded. But I've already responded. So this queued message is just catching up - it's the old message before my response. No action needed here.\n\nActually, I'm not sure if this queued message requires a response since I already responded to the feishu doc question. Let me just acknowledge that I already answered, since this message came in while I was working.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n已经回答过了——我用 Feishu SDK 直接写脚本调 API 创建的，因为 `feishu_doc` 工具没有出现在我的工具列表里。\n\n文档：https://feishu.cn/docx/QMNNdhiwRoSW4Tx9BoFcBj7wnsd"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":54825,"output":300,"cacheRead":80,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55205,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779192568145,"responseId":"chatcmpl-44b3d0a4-b7f9-4574-83bb-5a6571139459"}}
{"type":"message","id":"1a13adf7","parentId":"031dd168","timestamp":"2026-05-19T12:24:41.992Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6ff126d3c8a4b116bf7c9ccdcab\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-19 12:24 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6ff126d3c8a4b116bf7c9ccdcab]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 你能记住创建飞书文档的这个流程么，这是标准流程，还是需要加工"}],"timestamp":1779193481903}}
{"type":"message","id":"3e5e1d64","parentId":"1a13adf7","timestamp":"2026-05-19T12:25:15.600Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if I can remember the Feishu document creation workflow, and whether this is a standard workflow or needs any modifications. Let me think about what I learned:\n\n1. The `feishu_doc` tool is registered in OpenClaw's extension system but wasn't appearing in my available tools list\n2. I had to bypass the tool system and directly use the Feishu SDK via Node.js script\n3. The correct SDK initialization requires `AppType.SelfBuild` and `Domain.Feishu`\n4. Document creation uses `client.docx.document.create()`\n5. Permission granting uses `client.drive.permissionMember.create()`\n6. Ownership transfer uses `client.drive.permissionMember.transferOwner()`\n7. Clearing default content and writing blocks uses `client.docx.documentBlockChildren.get()` and `client.docx.documentBlockChildren.batchDelete()`\n8. Writing new blocks uses `client.docx.documentBlockChildren.create()`\n\nThis is valuable knowledge. I should save this to memory so I can recall it. Let me write this to today's memory file or update MEMORY.md.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n能记住。这是今天学的实际流程：\n\n**问题根源：** `feishu_doc` 工具在系统里注册了，但没出现在我的工具列表里（可能是 extension 注册 vs agent 工具列表同步的问题）。\n\n**正确做法（绕过了工具机制）：**\n1. 用 `AppType.SelfBuild` + `Domain.Feishu` 初始化 SDK\n2. `client.docx.document.create()` 建文档\n3. `client.drive.permissionMember.create()` 授权（full_access）\n4. `client.docx.documentBlockChildren.get()` 找到 page block id\n5. `client.docx.documentBlockChildren.batchDelete()` 清理默认内容\n6. `client.docx.documentBlockChildren.create()` 写入内容\n7. `client.drive.permissionMember.transferOwner()` 转移所有权\n\n需要加工的地方：把这段写成可复用的脚本或 skill，下次直接调。现在是临时脚本散在 `/app/dist/extensions/feishu/create_echo_doc.cjs`。\n\n要我整理到 MEMORY.md 里吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":46558,"output":439,"cacheRead":8720,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55717,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779193481993,"responseId":"chatcmpl-3cb81142-1470-472d-930b-1a1dc0f70020"}}
